INSERT INTO `knowledge_chunks` VALUES ('projects','bbcf5066-02ef-4839-8e00-f4f5406f','Academic Project: TikTak Project Using C. My 1st semester project (Tiktactoe) C language, a simple application has been prepared. The Tic-tac-toe is a pencil game for two players, X and O, who takes turns marking the spaces in a 3X3 grid player. Technologies: C. ','{\"tags\": [\"C\"], \"type\": \"academic_project\", \"title\": \"TikTak Project Using C\", \"category\": \"academicsproject\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','013d4a8a-54b2-4fee-8f58-a4a5180e'),('entity_contents','ccf47170-aea4-452f-a437-d9f50833','Participated in a cultural field trip and conducted a case study on the history of Patan Durbar Square, enhancing research, observation, and cultural heritage knowledge.','{\"type\": \"academic_detail\", \"entity_id\": \"ccf47170-aea4-452f-a437-d9f50833\", \"entity_type\": \"academic\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','067f5f1a-053c-438b-a4c5-8492c4aa'),('projects','44513486-14da-4092-b385-13ba0ec0','Project: Basic Ecommerce site . For Anapple construction to sell thier chemical product, Startup Store to sell Hats, Shoes and so-on Technologies: React, Redux, firebase. ','{\"tags\": [\"React\", \"Redux\", \"firebase\"], \"type\": \"project\", \"title\": \"Basic Ecommerce site \", \"category\": \"workproject\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','1ce3032b-0e3a-4e78-b269-025d0081'),('testimonials','260e2d29-e5b1-4a91-82d7-e1ad2817','Testimonial from Binod Maharjan, CEO at Nhubika Technology PVT LTD: An exceptional and adaptable developer who consistently delivers high-quality work on time, whether working independently or as part of a team.','{\"type\": \"testimonial\", \"author\": \"Binod Maharjan\", \"company\": \"Nhubika Technology PVT LTD\", \"designation\": \"CEO\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','22d98df6-34f0-44ba-973b-0d43b11d'),('testimonials','aa1d86d3-2b38-485a-abd2-3749079a','Testimonial from Basant Shrestha, CTO at ITConcerns: A seasoned System Administrator, DevOps professional, and skilled developer.','{\"type\": \"testimonial\", \"author\": \"Basant Shrestha\", \"company\": \"ITConcerns\", \"designation\": \"CTO\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','2345f6d4-f77a-4a6b-b245-e8ac7ae5'),('journey','c2a5a6ee-001d-4c48-a73e-ee0e467f','Work Experience: Internship at Shree Airlines. Project: Aircraft Maintenance Engineer Internship. Duration: 2017-11-06 to Present. Developing Technical Records.Developing Technical Library.Developing Production planning.Aircraft maintenance and supervision ','{\"type\": \"work_experience\", \"title\": \"Aircraft Maintenance Engineer Internship\", \"company\": \"Shree Airlines\", \"designation\": \"Internship\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','259db351-0022-4869-ae82-9b9b732d'),('academics','be44239f-eb2a-41a9-b014-559a16a7','Education: High School, National Campus, HSEB. Duration: 2011-01-01 to 2013-12-31. Passed with First Division Physics and Computer Science 73.60%','{\"type\": \"education\", \"title\": \"High School\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','27ac247d-76bf-489c-b823-bc0c8d94'),('journey','a8b04faa-d22b-493b-b020-aed5a592','Work Experience: Low voltage system design at Free Lancing . Project: Low Voltage Quality Control Engineer . Duration: 2019-02-01 to 2019-07-30. Designing and Monitoring:Network and communication:Fire alarm System: ','{\"type\": \"work_experience\", \"title\": \"Low Voltage Quality Control Engineer \", \"company\": \"Free Lancing \", \"designation\": \"Low voltage system design\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','310ad92e-141d-48da-ac4c-7f95ddda'),('projects','efae7d74-bb3f-43a6-9c26-9ae9755b','Project: Nerd Study Hub. All Tech and Engineering Solution in one Technologies: node, Redux, Nodejs, Sequalize. ','{\"tags\": [\"node\", \"Redux\", \"Nodejs\", \"Sequalize\"], \"type\": \"project\", \"title\": \"Nerd Study Hub\", \"category\": \"workproject\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','3604c2bb-d781-4db8-b9ca-02fdafd9'),('entity_contents','ccf47170-aea4-452f-a437-d9f50833','Participated in a team-based mandala making competition, demonstrating creativity, teamwork, and artistic skills.','{\"type\": \"academic_detail\", \"entity_id\": \"ccf47170-aea4-452f-a437-d9f50833\", \"entity_type\": \"academic\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','3d17915d-090d-48b8-8775-cb6fdf32'),('projects','1eb9d192-d11a-45c6-8f72-3cb02380','Academic Project: Bank Management System – C++. The topic for our project is \'Bank Management System\'. File handling has been effectively used for each feature of this project. Our Bank Management System can add records, search, modify &amp; delete records. General concepts of if while loops, functions, classes and file has been used to create this program. Technologies: C++. ','{\"tags\": [\"C++\"], \"type\": \"academic_project\", \"title\": \"Bank Management System – C++\", \"category\": \"academicsproject\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','3d549275-842f-4443-86e6-eb5b778d'),('users','1','Sahaj Shakya is a professional Contact: saz.shakya@gmail.com. Phone: 9841194900.','{\"type\": \"user_info\", \"title\": \"About Sahaj Shakya\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','40e42ccd-36b7-4c75-b6ba-9c3e3d5b'),('projects','89297556-b96d-4003-8581-4c174162','Project: Covid Tracker. Covid Tracker to track ongoing cases during Covid-19 Technologies: React, Redux, Firebase. ','{\"tags\": [\"React\", \"Redux\", \"Firebase\"], \"type\": \"project\", \"title\": \"Covid Tracker\", \"category\": \"workproject\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','48d78275-8021-4cb7-8eff-716dd753'),('journey','f8645475-ea63-48b3-984d-1504935d','Work Experience: Senior Backend Developer at Nerd Study Hub. Project: Freelancing Full Stack Developer. Duration: 2023-06-01 to Present. Experienced Full Stack Developer with expertise in designing, developing, deploying, and maintaining scalable web and desktop applications using modern technologies. Worked on diverse projects including healthcare platforms, mobile applications, municipal management systems, and enterprise solutions for international and local clients. Skilled in frontend development using React, Next.js, Remix, React Native, Electron, and Tailwind CSS, along with backend development using Node.js, Express, FastAPI, and RESTful API architectures.Experienced in database design and management using PostgreSQL, Sequelize, SQLAlchemy, and Alembic, including schema design, migrations, and query optimisation. Implemented secure authentication and authorization systems, optimized application performance through code splitting and efficient architecture, and developed cross-platform applications with responsive user interfaces.Hands-on experience with cloud deployment and DevOps practices, including hosting applications on DigitalOcean and AWS EC2, server management, Samba-based file sharing, Jenkins CI/CD pipeline integration, and Grafana monitoring and logging. Skilled in troubleshooting, system optimization, API integration, and delivering reliable software solutions while collaborating with cross-functional teams. ','{\"type\": \"work_experience\", \"title\": \"Freelancing Full Stack Developer\", \"company\": \"Nerd Study Hub\", \"designation\": \"Senior Backend Developer\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','4f064bf8-1a6a-43e4-a3f5-d1d07e09'),('entity_contents','94195fc6-5e29-4258-b89b-2a69fec0','Demonstrated a density-based traffic light control system at a technical competition, showcasing the use of ultrasonic sensors to detect vehicle density and dynamically adjust traffic signal timings. Presented the working prototype, explained its real-world applications in reducing traffic congestion through sensor-based automation, and effectively communicated the system\'s design, functionality, and implementation to judges and attendees. The demonstration highlighted practical problem-solving, teamwork, and technical presentation skills.','{\"type\": \"academic_detail\", \"entity_id\": \"94195fc6-5e29-4258-b89b-2a69fec0\", \"entity_type\": \"academic\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','4f5ca4bd-bd3c-4840-ade3-c2d6ca39'),('projects','3e1035d4-4914-41b0-bed1-3919c190','Project: Smart Health Ward. Ward3 Lab report Management System (Application made for lalitpur Ward 3) Technologies: Nodejs, React, Redux. ','{\"tags\": [\"Nodejs\", \"React\", \"Redux\"], \"type\": \"project\", \"title\": \"Smart Health Ward\", \"category\": \"workproject\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','520f9853-b3d4-45f7-b7d2-f618be5a'),('projects','f05b15eb-9425-4f27-b097-a4cc1d04','Project: Density Based Traffic Light. Density Based Automatic Traffic Light Controlled System that helps to control traffics and reduces accidents. Technologies: Arduino. ','{\"tags\": [\"Arduino\"], \"type\": \"project\", \"title\": \"Density Based Traffic Light\", \"category\": \"workproject\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','5e2f8a74-0f24-4075-a977-68209a63'),('entity_contents','94195fc6-5e29-4258-b89b-2a69fec0','Attended the graduation ceremony upon the successful completion of the Bachelor of Engineering programme, marking the achievement of academic and professional milestones.','{\"type\": \"academic_detail\", \"entity_id\": \"94195fc6-5e29-4258-b89b-2a69fec0\", \"entity_type\": \"academic\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','6d0aba9a-fb84-441e-8bff-bf070a51'),('entity_contents','ffabb298-25af-4a2e-8af2-c27848df','Attended the Master\'s Convocation Ceremony at Pokhara University, celebrating the successful completion of postgraduate studies and the achievement of an important academic milestone. The event recognised academic excellence and marked the formal conferment of the master\'s degree.','{\"type\": \"academic_detail\", \"entity_id\": \"ffabb298-25af-4a2e-8af2-c27848df\", \"entity_type\": \"academic\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','75e39606-3350-41d6-8cb8-f2fa97f0'),('entity_contents','94195fc6-5e29-4258-b89b-2a69fec0','Designed and developed an EMG-based bio-robotic arm that replicates the natural movements of a human arm by capturing and processing electromyography (EMG) signals from muscles. Integrated EMG sensors, a microcontroller, and servo motors to translate muscle activity into real-time robotic arm movements, providing a low-cost prosthetic solution for amputees. The control system was designed to be adaptable, allowing the same hardware and signal-processing approach to be tuned for lower-limb prosthetic applications with minimal modifications.','{\"type\": \"academic_detail\", \"entity_id\": \"94195fc6-5e29-4258-b89b-2a69fec0\", \"entity_type\": \"academic\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','80b0fa9b-f867-4818-a21b-44498042'),('journey','64b36d64-4049-45bc-921d-b49617a0','Work Experience: Junior Telecom and Network Engineer at Mercantile telecommunication. Project: Network and System Engineer. Duration: 2018-06-01 to Present. Routing and SwitchingServer Virtualization (Red Hat o/s and IDirect Guest o/s)Monitoring and management of overall satellite bandwidthL2 Support and maintenance of both client and hub sideMonitoring of overall satellite carrier and spill overInstallation and configuration of new carrier wave ','{\"type\": \"work_experience\", \"title\": \"Network and System Engineer\", \"company\": \"Mercantile telecommunication\", \"designation\": \"Junior Telecom and Network Engineer\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','81e25a46-363a-4625-b59e-1dc1f4b6'),('achievements','ef6845ea-33f3-4baa-a084-93fd7c84','Achievement: Technical Exhibition Organizer & Judge . Served as an Organizer and Judge for KEC LITE 2081 at Kantipur Engineering College, contributing to the planning, coordination, and successful execution of the technical exhibition. Managed technical activities, supported project demonstrations, evaluated innovative student projects as a judge, and collaborated with teams to ensure smooth event operations. Tags: KecLITE. ','{\"tags\": [\"KecLITE\"], \"type\": \"achievement\", \"title\": \"Technical Exhibition Organizer & Judge \"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','82de3381-038a-4120-8e16-318f889e'),('academics','ccf47170-aea4-452f-a437-d9f50833','Education: SLC, Bhassara Secondary School, Nepal Government. Duration: 1998-01-01 to 2011-12-31. Excellence AwardPassed with Distinction 84.25%Artist Award','{\"type\": \"education\", \"title\": \"SLC\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','878ed5e8-ad8f-4fd5-9515-fcf16d38'),('projects','8d853fa4-27e8-4148-88e9-6c76bffc','Academic Project: Thesis: SDN Load Balancing and DDoS Detection. This prject reduces the overhead in traffic, classify between traffic and DDoS Attack using SVM, find optimal path using DFS Technologies: SDN, Multipath. ','{\"tags\": [\"SDN\", \"Multipath\"], \"type\": \"academic_project\", \"title\": \"Thesis: SDN Load Balancing and DDoS Detection\", \"category\": \"academicsproject\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','8aabbdbf-f72a-4fdf-8ea7-e8eccce4'),('entity_contents','be44239f-eb2a-41a9-b014-559a16a7','Participated in the organisation and celebration of the school\'s annual prom night, demonstrating teamwork, communication, and social engagement.','{\"type\": \"academic_detail\", \"entity_id\": \"be44239f-eb2a-41a9-b014-559a16a7\", \"entity_type\": \"academic\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','8b5eba69-603a-4db1-8b1b-0819ecac'),('journey','77ec1914-f076-4897-8af9-88325c15','Work Experience: Senior Lecturer at Kantipur Engineering College. Project: Academic Journey. Duration: 2019-11-18 to Present. Progressed from Lab Assistant to Senior Lecturer at Kantipur Engineering College, delivering courses in Filter Design, RF and Microwave Engineering, Internet and Intranet, and Computer Networks. Conducted laboratory sessions, developed course materials, supervised final-year projects, mentored students in technical exhibitions, and contributed to research and academic development. ','{\"type\": \"work_experience\", \"title\": \"Academic Journey\", \"company\": \"Kantipur Engineering College\", \"designation\": \"Senior Lecturer\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','8c5040fe-be70-4d1c-bfac-e20cdb3b'),('journey','c1246171-0b86-4f96-8f5f-f91ea488','Work Experience: IT Engineer at ItConcerns. Project: React Developer and DevOps. Duration: 2019-09-01 to 2023-05-31. JavaScript Application Development on both client (React) and server-side (Node, Django)Working on cloud technologies such as AWS and AlibabaManage network servers and technology toolsAutomation of the software development lifecycle.Collaboration, Communication, CI/CD, Microservices ','{\"type\": \"work_experience\", \"title\": \"React Developer and DevOps\", \"company\": \"ItConcerns\", \"designation\": \"IT Engineer\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','90df2c17-4364-448a-904f-a77052c4'),('testimonials','1c1fc004-d439-486a-b65e-407ee281','Testimonial from Narad Karki , VSAT and Radio Head at Mercantile Telecommunication: A hardworking, multi-talented, sincere, and highly dedicated individual.','{\"type\": \"testimonial\", \"author\": \"Narad Karki \", \"company\": \"Mercantile Telecommunication\", \"designation\": \"VSAT and Radio Head\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','923eb91b-e9b1-4808-8ee3-14737246'),('entity_contents','ccf47170-aea4-452f-a437-d9f50833','participated in a talent show as a guitarist, performing in front of an audience. This experience strengthened my confidence, stage presence, and ability to perform under pressure. It also demonstrated my dedication, creativity, and teamwork while showcasing my passion for music and continuous self-imvement.','{\"type\": \"academic_detail\", \"entity_id\": \"ccf47170-aea4-452f-a437-d9f50833\", \"entity_type\": \"academic\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','9a9aaee8-624c-461f-ae6b-94df54fc'),('entity_contents','ffabb298-25af-4a2e-8af2-c27848df','Received the Overall Excellence Result Award in recognition of outstanding academic performance and consistent achievement throughout the academic programme. The award acknowledges dedication, hard work, and excellence in maintaining a high standard of academic success.','{\"type\": \"academic_detail\", \"entity_id\": \"ffabb298-25af-4a2e-8af2-c27848df\", \"entity_type\": \"academic\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','9ea3fbf0-f45d-4566-b74b-803ec678'),('projects','bf5782f5-8f35-4904-905a-a3cb6277','Project: Ward Darta Chalani. The Ward Darta System consists of two main components: a desktop application (Darta UI) and a backend service (Chalani Darta Backend). Technologies: Nodejs, Redux, Sequalize, Electron. ','{\"tags\": [\"Nodejs\", \"Redux\", \"Sequalize\", \"Electron\"], \"type\": \"project\", \"title\": \"Ward Darta Chalani\", \"category\": \"workproject\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','a029cf5f-e25d-45b7-8ec0-1115cf4f'),('projects','7e0a7a45-5cda-49e7-b04c-b4ecf6c3','Project: Paige: Diet Coaching Applications. An Israel based Full Stack Development Application using react(Formik, reduxtoolkit, joy, materialUI, styledComponents) and Node(Express, Sequalize, Postgres) and Hybrid App development using React Native Technologies: React Query, Formik, React Context API, React Native, Socket, Postgres, React, nodejs. ','{\"tags\": [\"React Query\", \"Formik\", \"React Context API\", \"React Native\", \"Socket\", \"Postgres\", \"React\", \"nodejs\"], \"type\": \"project\", \"title\": \"Paige: Diet Coaching Applications\", \"category\": \"workproject\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','a26a032e-d4ef-4e16-983a-bd060c1f'),('academics','ffabb298-25af-4a2e-8af2-c27848df','Education: Masters in Computer Engineering, Nepal College of Information and Technology, Pokhara University. Duration: 2019-01-01 to 2022-12-31. Passed with Excellence 3.92 CGPAUniversity Topper in 3rd SemesterCollege topper in all Semesters','{\"type\": \"education\", \"title\": \"Masters in Computer Engineering\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','b2acb0c9-448d-4b7f-aa97-9afe99ab'),('journey','de2bf4ae-4e3f-4b2a-a404-acbf01f1','Work Experience: Guest Sr Lecturer at Kathford: Engineering and Management College. Project: Part time Lecturer(Present Kathford). Duration: 2023-06-01 to Present. Kathford Engineering College (June 2023 to Present)Lecturer for subject“Filter Design”,“Rf and Microwave Engineering” and“Internet and Intranet(KEC Only)”Lab Works on Subject such as“Microprocessor”,“Internet and Intranet”,“Rf and Microwave Engineering,“Embedded System” ','{\"type\": \"work_experience\", \"title\": \"Part time Lecturer(Present Kathford)\", \"company\": \"Kathford: Engineering and Management College\", \"designation\": \"Guest Sr Lecturer\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','bea299ad-bbd9-4aee-ada7-ef77d738'),('entity_contents','94195fc6-5e29-4258-b89b-2a69fec0','Designed, fabricated, and tested a Yagi-Uda directional antenna for terrestrial TV signal reception, specifically tuned to receive Kantipur TV broadcasts. Calculated antenna element dimensions and spacing based on the operating frequency, assembled the antenna, and evaluated its performance through practical testing. Optimised the design to improve signal strength, directivity, and reception quality while applying principles of antenna theory and wireless communication.','{\"type\": \"academic_detail\", \"entity_id\": \"94195fc6-5e29-4258-b89b-2a69fec0\", \"entity_type\": \"academic\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','c01c1bb9-9844-4f4e-a146-5dd7dd96'),('testimonials','cfc64686-418f-4012-824f-b76e95fa','Testimonial from Rabindra Khati , Head of Department at Kantipur Engineering College: An exceptional team player and an inspiring team leader','{\"type\": \"testimonial\", \"author\": \"Rabindra Khati \", \"company\": \"Kantipur Engineering College\", \"designation\": \"Head of Department\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','caf59b0f-3495-4abd-9f0d-3c55bd2f'),('entity_contents','94195fc6-5e29-4258-b89b-2a69fec0','Developed a density-based traffic control system using ultrasonic sensors to detect vehicle density and automatically switch traffic signals based on real-time traffic conditions. The project focused on improving traffic flow and reducing congestion through sensor-based automation. Successfully designed, implemented, and tested the prototype as part of a team, and the project was recognised with the Best Minor Project award for its innovation and practical application.\n','{\"type\": \"academic_detail\", \"entity_id\": \"94195fc6-5e29-4258-b89b-2a69fec0\", \"entity_type\": \"academic\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','ceb579b1-5238-480a-943b-dcd28881'),('projects','b7dbe8ee-6aac-48da-b054-58d15a3c','Project: Inventory Management Application. Inventory Management Application to track goods and supplies Technologies: React, Sequalize, postgres, nodejs. ','{\"tags\": [\"React\", \"Sequalize\", \"postgres\", \"nodejs\"], \"type\": \"project\", \"title\": \"Inventory Management Application\", \"category\": \"workproject\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','cf66b0ce-03dc-4804-ae07-f00d1840'),('entity_contents','ffabb298-25af-4a2e-8af2-c27848df','Published a research paper in the International Journal of Advanced Social Sciences on improving horizontal fragmentation in distributed database systems using fuzzy logic and precedence values. The study proposed an efficient data fragmentation approach to optimise data distribution, balance network load, and enhance the performance of distributed database systems.','{\"type\": \"academic_detail\", \"entity_id\": \"ffabb298-25af-4a2e-8af2-c27848df\", \"entity_type\": \"academic\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','d260abb6-9475-4385-8656-7c3a3584'),('projects','7e63dbdb-2120-4af9-95cd-e5aa3faa','Project: Amazon Clone. An Amazon clone built with React, Redux, and Firebase. It allows users to browse products, add them to their cart, and make secure purchases. The app utilizes Redux for state management and Firebase for user authentication and real-time database functionality, providing a smooth and dynamic shopping experience. Technologies: React, React, Redux. ','{\"tags\": [\"React\", \"React\", \"Redux\"], \"type\": \"project\", \"title\": \"Amazon Clone\", \"category\": \"workproject\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','e163dceb-3bc1-461b-98da-9ad61483'),('achievements','cbe19331-ce6d-4635-bd16-ca67a78a','Achievement: Face of College. Recognized as the Face of the College and featured in the institution\'s official branding and promotional materials. Appeared on the college calendar, campus banners, official posters, and digital marketing campaigns, representing the college\'s academic excellence, innovation, and student achievements. Served as a student ambassador, promoting the institution through various print and digital media. Tags: faceofcollege. ','{\"tags\": [\"faceofcollege\"], \"type\": \"achievement\", \"title\": \"Face of College\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','e932c29d-2e9b-4bc1-a674-395eea55'),('achievements','da837d90-712b-40b6-b582-0f956a36','Achievement: Best Project Winners. Best Major &amp; Minor Project WinnerAwarded Best Major Project and Best Minor Project for developing innovative engineering solutions that demonstrated strong technical knowledge, practical implementation, and real-world impact. Tags: best major project, best minor project. ','{\"tags\": [\"best major project\", \"best minor project\"], \"type\": \"achievement\", \"title\": \"Best Project Winners\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','ebd5f842-5bd9-4abc-9ae2-c9ca0bef'),('achievements','2327e20d-9367-4140-9928-5c7188d4','Achievement: Kec Conference and Journal. Served as a key member of the KEC Conference and Journal Editor Committee, contributing in multiple roles including IT Head, Organizer, Reviewer, and Manager for KEC Conference 2021, 2022, and 2025 (2082). Managed technical and IT-related operations, supported conference planning and execution, reviewed research papers for technical quality and relevance, and coordinated academic and operational activities to ensure the successful organization of the conferences. Contributed to maintaining research standards, improving event management processes, and supporting the overall success of KEC’s academic initiatives. Tags: kec conference, kec Journal. ','{\"tags\": [\"kec conference\", \"kec Journal\"], \"type\": \"achievement\", \"title\": \"Kec Conference and Journal\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','f05be0dc-8905-41bf-bc2a-ecf749f3'),('photography','e1db99a2-7dd9-42f2-8da1-8e787961','Photography Album: One little sparrow. Endless main character energy 🐦✨. Weekend plans officially upgraded from balcony sitting to accidental bird photography 👀📸Sony a6300 paired with Tamron 16-300mm EF Lens Tags: BirdPhotography, Sparrow, NatureClicks, BalconyView, WeekendMood. ','{\"tags\": [\"BirdPhotography\", \"Sparrow\", \"NatureClicks\", \"BalconyView\", \"WeekendMood\"], \"type\": \"photography\", \"title\": \"One little sparrow. Endless main character energy 🐦✨\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','f40cf6c1-1d5d-4cc6-bbc5-a2f3bf19'),('academics','94195fc6-5e29-4258-b89b-2a69fec0','Education: Bachelors in Electronics and Communication Engineering, Kantipur Engineering College, Tribhuvan University. Duration: 2014-01-01 to 2018-12-31. Passed with First Division 73.95%Best Minor Project AwardBest Major Project Award','{\"type\": \"education\", \"title\": \"Bachelors in Electronics and Communication Engineering\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','fa6d8a53-1d47-4e1b-9db7-dacee50a'),('projects','57b46cdc-df70-4178-bb1c-9d709069','Academic Project: Bio Robotic Arm. “Bio-Robotic arm” is project based on a biofeedback mechanical arm that uses a low dimensional input derived from EMG (electromyography) data. Technologies: Arduino, RaspberryPi, Python, EMG. ','{\"tags\": [\"Arduino\", \"RaspberryPi\", \"Python\", \"EMG\"], \"type\": \"academic_project\", \"title\": \"Bio Robotic Arm\", \"category\": \"academicsproject\"}','2026-08-01 18:41:13','feeb03a3-9df0-447b-9ea4-89d03e7d');
